    "identifier": "futton-boil-release-freight-train",
    "description": "<p>You vent every chamber of Boil release within your body at once, your chakra roaring like an over pressurized engine. For the duration, you become like a Freight Train, gaining the following benefits;</p>\n<p>Relentless Motion. Your speed is increased by +30 feet.</p>\n<p>Impact Engine. Once per turn, when you deal [Unarmed Damage] or [Weapon Damage] to a creature, you can force them to make a Strength saving throw. On a failure, they are knocked Prone, Bruised, and gain a rank of Scald. On a success, they are pushed 5 feet.</p>\n<p>Unstoppable Force. You gain immunity to the Prone, Slowed, Shaken and Grappled conditions. You also cannot be moved against your will and difficult terrain does not affect you.</p>\n<p>Overheat. When this jutsu ends, you need to vent the extra heat from your body. You are Incapacitated until the end of your next turn.</p>",
